      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://iagenweb.org/mitchell/localdat/toetervi.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fred Stoyke opened the first post office in the village’s general merchandise store, making it the town’s communication hub.",
